# SkyWright line-ending policy (houseCARL's, less its paths that did not move).
# Generated data formats stay LF; source files keep git's normal handling; binary fixtures are never converted.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.bsa binary
docs/TOOLS.md text eol=lf
